\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Cross-agent transfer on OpenHands. Structural features outperform the best LLM judge by 18.4\,pp ($p{<}0.001$, bootstrap) and zero-shot probes by 28--37\,pp. LLM results are on a matched 2,000-window stratified subset; structural GB evaluated on the same subset for direct comparison.}}{4}{table.caption.8}\protected@file@percent }
